# Normalise every text file to LF, in the repository and in working copies.
# Godot writes LF on all platforms; without this, Git on Windows rewrites each
# file to CRLF and the two halves of the project trade whitespace-only diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets. Never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pck binary
*.zip binary
